    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/f393beba022bada79aea30ca8928da3d.poster.avif?t=1753958011\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/f393beba022bada79aea30ca8928da3d.webm?t=1753958011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/f393beba022bada79aea30ca8928da3d.mp4?t=1753958011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leona, a skilled gunslinger living on the fringes of the law, seeks a chance to clear her nam.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/e31baaee9b9f5aa831856352aedf1edd.avif?t=1753958011\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, she meets Lurie, a sketchy demi-human, who persuades her to enter the combat tournament held at the Colosseum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grand prize is a full pardon for all past crimes. To win her freedom, Leona must rely on her strength, strategy, and wit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Leona outsmart her opponents and rise as the undisputed champion?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/e6c9ac3f870080fe1715aa00894bffa7.avif?t=1753958011\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Perform various jobs to enhance your abilities and earn money.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/802b9381647c7fd2f3be5541aef46832.avif?t=1753958011\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Take a break once in a while to restore Health and recover from combat debuffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Spend money on gear, items, and specialized combat training. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fight powerful opponents in 1v1 tactical matches.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/2626c291da41de4125eed1ce9b037f61.avif?t=1753958011\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Prepare your deck of skills before battle, and select the best moves to counter your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Each skill has a fixed cost and requires sufficient stats to activate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Accurately predicting the opponent's next move depends on Leona's foresight ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Quick move selection and successive turns without taking damage will increase Leona's Excitement gauge. A high Excitement level triggers her &quot;Trigger-Happy&quot; mode, boosting her attack power.<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/7d431d2e51bf8ba400715ddd60c35947.avif?t=1753958011\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leona the Silver-Tongued</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leona can use her sharp wit to negotiate with various characters she meets.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/3f097bbb447c4640eb22ab769cb95c91.avif?t=1753958011\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the situation, her words can unlock new opportunities, reveal hidden information, or lead to unexpected challenges.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/e4b7087bc5b68fa930472d5e05308a8e.avif?t=1753958011\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >H-Content &amp; Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains consensual adult content that unfolds based on player choices and the relationships Leona builds.<br>- 33 H-CGs (including Live2D scenes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seven portrait poses x Seven different outfits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All scenes are designed to reflect the character's journey and decisions, with no non-consensual or violent content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*All content within the game is uncensored.*</h2>",
