https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/e4b7087bc5b68fa930472d5e05308a8e.avif?t=1753958011\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >H-Content &amp; Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains consensual adult content that unfolds based on player choices and the relationships Leona builds.<br>- 33 H-CGs (including Live2D scenes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seven portrait poses x Seven different outfits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All scenes are designed to reflect the character's journey and decisions, with no non-consensual or violent content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*All content within the game is uncensored.*</h2>",
